WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:05.810
Inquisitor, are you aware of the Queen's recent decree?

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.730
I believe I was told

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.400
it was regarding the crack down on rebels.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:12.200
That is correct.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.240
The Queen wishes to purge all the rebels,

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.700
in other words Annelotte and her followers,

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.410
that are disrupting order on the continent.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:25.420
We would like to ask for your assitance in this matter, Sigui-dono.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:28.380
I am merely an Inquisitor who serves the Lord.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:33.220
It's not my place to aid in the rounding up of rebels.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.760
Even if the Queen orders you to do so?

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:42.930
I follow only the will of God.

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:44.600
God...

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:46.770
If your belief in God is so strong,

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:49.650
then that's all the more reason you should aid in this matter.

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:51.030
I don't understand what you mean.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.030
The rebel, Annelotte,

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:54.400
has demon blood coursing through her veins.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:58.030
She is a heretic.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.620
Demon blood coursing through her veins?

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:07.420
I was born crying alone.

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:12.920
In a horizon of light and darkness.

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:18.260
Why not obtain these bonds.

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:26.600
They were shining in my hands just now.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:39.490
The melancholy of one in sever billion.

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:44.830
Someday the end of the world will come.

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:50.210
So what? I'll have no regret.

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:58.630
Say, yeah!! Stop running straight after that falling star.

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:03.430
Let your worries fade away!!

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:08.730
This blue Earth is nestled in the sky.

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:14.070
Like I always envisioned Elysium.

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:19.410
I will shape my own past and future.

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:24.790
I will look up to the eternal Stellar.

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:30.210
I can hear the song of life.

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:48.730
Gorillas look best in a cage, don't they?

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:52.560
Did you know that they started

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:53.820
taking out the beautiful warriors?

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.490
They're saying we can do in any warrior like you

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:00.610
that defies Onee-sama.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.240
W-What's so funny?!

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:07.830
Elina, you're as stupid as always.

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:10.620
You wanna say that again?

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.170
Do you understand the position you're—

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:14.250
The Phantom Warrior, Maria.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:16.920
Looks like you've heard the name before.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.380
The mysterious warrior that's been

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.930
starting riots against Onee-sama across the land...

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.100
Don't tell me you know who she really is?!

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:27.310
Tell me, Risty!

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:29.180
If you don't tell me, you're going to regret it!

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:30.810
I'd like that...

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.600
There hasn't been anything interesting

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:34.520
going on around here lately.

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:36.650
You've got me excited now!

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:45.070
Hey, aren't we getting hungry a little too fast?

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:47.030
I know what you mean...

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:49.000
Ever since we left that wife,

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.160
no matter how much we eat...

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:53.670
I can't go any further...

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.540
Oh well.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:58.340
I'll go search for some decent food.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:03:59.460
Thanks...

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:10.600
Who goes there? Show yourself.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:13.390
Children?

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:15.100
She has a sword!

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.980
I knew she was a soldier of the Queen!

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:20.110
Wait. I'm not a soldier—

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.650
We have to call for Izumi-chan!

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:24.360
Izumi-chan!

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:29.040
The heavens, the earth, and  the people call to me.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.500
They tell me to defeat evil.

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.210
The War God Samurai, Izumi, has arrived!

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.500
Izumi-chan!

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:40.880
Now that I am here, you have nothing to worry about.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:42.840
A samurai...

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.720
Soldier of the Queen,

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.510
I will not allow any further violence!

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:49.430
What say you?

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.770
Fight me fair and square!

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:55.440
Or is that sword just for show?

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:57.980
For show...

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.570
That might be true for me right now.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:01.530
What—

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.030
You made her surrender without fighting!

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:06.530
Izumi-chan won!

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:08.620
Yeah! I knew you could do it!

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:16.000
What? So you're not a soldier?

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.670
Good thing huh, Izumi-chan?

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:19.000
Oh, yeah...

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.420
But if real soldiers did come here,

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:24.590
Izumi-chan would get rid of them in an instant!

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.630
O-Of course!

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:28.300
You're so cool, Izumi-chan!

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:29.430
Yeah!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.720
Are there only children in this village?

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:33.680
Yeah.

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.600
But Izumi-chan is here now,

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.400
so we're safe, even if evil soldiers come.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.060
Evil soldiers?

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:40.650
The Queen's soldiers.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:42.900
They keep coming to raid the villages around here.

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:45.780
The army would even attack a village like this?

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:58.960
So the Queen's army is coming to small villages like these...

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.540
What are you planning?

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:02.670
Why, um...

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:05.590
Why did you sheathe your sword earlier?

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:07.170
I'm not sure...

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:09.260
You thought I was weak, so you—

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:11.180
No human starts out strong.

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:14.430
Anyone can train and become strong.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.930
Even me?

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.140
That's right.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.350
Well, you know...

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:21.980
If you want, um...

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:25.030
you can train me how to fight with a sword.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:25.900
Huh?

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:28.990
I-I'm saying if you want to teach me so badly,

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:31.490
I guess I could let you.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:36.500
Are you demanding that I teach you sword techniques?

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:37.830
I mean...

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.880
I'm saying you can make me your apprentice!

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:42.210
You do have apprentices, right?

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:43.880
Apprentices...

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:51.390
I don't think you could call any of them apprentices...

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:55.600
I swore that I would protect these kids.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:58.680
They don't have anyone other than me.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:03.810
Hey!

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:07.740
So what? I said all that for nothing?!

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.320
Take this!

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:17.450
Your charge was weak.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:18.540
Twenty points.

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:22.170
What was that about?

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:25.590
Something someone who used to train me would have said.

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:30.010
In the end, I never was able to get 100 points, though.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.260
I guess it's my turn now.

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:34.300
What? Then...

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.220
I'll help you if you'd like.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:39.430
I see!

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:42.520
W-Well, if you insist then I guess I can't refuse.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.780
Those with a small body shouldn't try to attack with power.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:58.040
Utilize your speed and strike with precision.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:58.740
Come!

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:01.460
Hands!

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:02.500
Sides!

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.880
And now the forehead.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.920
If you hit your opponent with accurate strikes,

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.420
you can take them out without using power.

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.550
If... If I do that, will I be able to get a 100?

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:13.880
If you worry about your score the whole time,

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:16.180
you're never going to get any better.

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:16.930
What...

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:20.310
If you're this strong,

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:23.270
couldn't you take out the entire Queen's army by yourself?

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:26.060
There are rebellions all over.

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:27.230
Even you could...

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.110
Izumi.

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:33.530
You're talking too much. Twenty points.

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.460
Izumi-chan!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.170
Hey, Annelotte.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:50.800
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:52.800
Fix your posture!

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.130
Twenty points.

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:56.340
You're not using your waist!

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:58.300
Izumi-chan.

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:01.640
She's trying to take the stuffed bear

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:03.730
that I found in the forest.

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:06.020
I want to hold the bear, too.

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:08.610
I found him!

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:09.690
Listen up, you two.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:13.360
What would the bear think about you two fighting?

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.490
I think he'd be sad.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:18.620
Do you want the bear to go

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.120
back to the forest because he's sad?

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.160
No!

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.540
Then what should you do?

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:24.660
Let's play together.

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:25.620
Yeah!

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:26.250
All right.

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:26.960
One hundred points.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:28.960
You can hold him first!

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.710
Let's switch when we get to the water!

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.630
W-What?

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:34.920
Nothing.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.380
Anyway, let's get started.

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:42.720
Why are there only children here?

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:45.230
All the adults were caught up in all the fighting.

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.690
The children have managed get by on their own

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:50.150
by cultivating the fields.

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:52.610
Lately, though, the Queen's soldiers

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:55.650
have started raiding this village.

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:58.110
Delicious!

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.570
This is bad!

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.540
Someone's coming toward the village!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:04.540
Soldiers?

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:05.960
I don't know...

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:07.540
There was only one of them, but they're carrying a sword.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.380
Izumi-chan.

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.340
It'll be fine. Just leave it to me.

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:36.490
The heavens, the earth, and  the people call to me.

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:38.070
They tell me to defeat evil—

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:39.030
Maria!

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.200
It is! It's Maria!

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.200
Maria!

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.250
Huh? Who is it?

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:54.040
Hey, guys. It's been a while.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:56.210
Maria?

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.050
Is she...

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.760
The Phantom Warrior, Maria?

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:09.180
Hey Maria, will you sleep with me tonight?

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:11.940
No! Maria's going to sleep with me!

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:14.270
All right! I'll sleep with everyone!

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:14.770
Yeah!

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:15.520
Yay!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:18.490
Maria, I've heard the stories about you.

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.320
You've been leading rebellions all across

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:23.280
the continent against the Queen.

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.080
And people have begun to call you

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:27.580
the Phantom Warrior because of your sudden appearances.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.620
When did I get to be so famous?

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.130
Whaddya mean?

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:35.380
You won the last Queen's Blade—

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:37.550
Idiot. No one knows about that,

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.010
so you're not supposed to talk about it.

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:40.130
Huh?

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:40.880
Did you say something?

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:42.680
No. Nothing.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:46.640
So, why is this <i>Maria</i> in the village anyway?

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:48.970
Maria saved the village.

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:50.770
She saved it?

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:53.190
She taught us a lot of stuff when the village

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:55.480
was in trouble because all the adults were gone.

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:59.990
So why did you just leave the village to its own devices?!

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:03.360
That's because she's the Wandering Warrior.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.160
Shh!

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:07.330
Huh?

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.160
W-What?

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.250
She's sleeping.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.250
W-What?!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:19.590
She fell asleep.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:21.800
Maria falls asleep really fast.

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:40.860
Annelotte!

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:44.280
What, are you leaving already?

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:47.200
I can't impose on you forever.

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:50.040
But we still have more sword practice left...

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:52.830
You'll be fine now.

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:54.370
And Maria's there now.

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:57.250
Have it your way!

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.250
Jerk!

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.900
A camp for the Queen's army.

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:26.910
What's going on?

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:34.160
I finally got a decent meal.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:37.420
I ended up eating Belphe's portion, too.

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:39.880
A demon! Belphe...

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.340
He has a companion?

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:43.340
Don't tell me...

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:46.430
The village where Izumi is...

00:13:56.940 --> 00:14:01.440
I waited and waited but I just can't take it anymore...

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:04.690
The children look delicious, but this woman is just so...

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:11.280
I can protect everyone if I work hard, too.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:19.880
Everyone keeps talking about Maria.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:22.290
Why Maria?!

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:26.720
W-What the heck are you?!

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:29.470
I can't take it anymore!

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:31.050
I can't!

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:33.760
A-A demon?!

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:38.890
Where did you go?!

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:41.310
Izumi-chan...

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.070
What's going on?

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:44.530
Stay inside!

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:49.240
Now, I think I'll start by eating all of you!

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.200
Maria... Wake Maria!

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:57.830
We can't!

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:00.460
Once Maria goes to sleep, she doesn't wake up for a long time!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:01.920
What the hell?

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:07.840
The house!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:10.430
It's fine. Everyone's over here today.

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:12.090
All right. Everyone, hide!

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.300
Izumi-chan!

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:19.140
This thing...is on a whole different level from the Queen's soldiers.

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:21.900
Annelotte isn't here.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.480
Maria's asleep.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:24.860
So that means...

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:29.700
that the only one who can protect this village and the children...

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:32.320
is me.

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:41.040
Izumi.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:43.960
You smell like our wife!

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.050
Izumi-chan.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:52.260
I-I'm fine... Don't worry, guys.

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:05.060
Oh, no!

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:08.730
Just what I'd expect from the finest ingredient...

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:11.360
You're so fresh I can't stand it!

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:13.280
I won't let you get away!

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:29.090
You're surprisingly tough.

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:31.130
I'm hungry!

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:36.050
Guys!

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:47.650
How dare you...

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:52.280
Izumi!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:58.030
I-Izumi...

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:07.130
Now I'll be able to have an excellent meal...

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:08.540
Don't mind if I do.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.550
I can't hold back any longer...

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:18.970
Time to take a bite—

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:22.140
Let go of Izumi!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.430
Get a hold of yourself!

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:28.230
Ow! I'm going to eat you up!

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:30.650
Izumi-chan, save us!

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.030
I won't give up.

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:40.120
I promised these kids that I would protect them!

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:44.040
I am... I am the War God Samurai,

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:46.460
Izumi!

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:50.840
Izumi, run!

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:56.550
Hands!

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:57.930
Sides!

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:00.890
Forehead!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:03.430
Izumi-chan!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:04.680
You can do it, Izumi-chan!

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.440
This is the finishing blow!

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:26.080
Like a carp on the cutting board.

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:29.830
Don't make a fuss when you're about to be eaten.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:33.920
Thanks for the meal!

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.340
Izumi-chan, no!

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:50.350
Carp become dragons when they travel up a waterfall.

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:59.360
Dragon Tail!

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:02.490
You...

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:20.340
M-Maria, thank you.

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:24.010
She's asleep.

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:26.890
You know...

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:28.680
Izumi-chan!

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:46.280
I slept well!

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:57.630
Maria.

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:00.340
Are you leaving already?

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:04.010
You did well, Izumi.

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:08.100
I heard your voice in my dream.

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:12.850
Your shouts gave everyone courage.

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:16.150
If one person puts their mind to something,

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:19.150
they can move something much larger.

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:23.070
Until we meet again.

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:34.880
Annelotte.

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.040
Take this.

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:43.590
I'd really would like to stay longer, but...

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:47.800
You can help more than just a small village like this.

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:51.850
Me and everyone else here will be sure to protect this village!

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:53.310
You're right.

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:54.690
I don't have to worry if you're here.

00:20:57.730 --> 00:20:59.940
Izumi, keep them safe for me.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:02.150
Right, Anegimi!

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:07.570
"If one person puts their mind to something,

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:10.620
they can move something much larger," huh?

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:13.660
I no longer need to worry.

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:15.120
I no longer need to hesitate.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:22.760
I will take this determination I have within me,

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:25.800
and continue down a new path.

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:31.640
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:33.560
I won't leave anymore.

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:36.350
Let's change this continent together!

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:13.910
I could have taken out those weird

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:17.450
stuffed animals on my own, you know!

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:22.330
Maria and Annelotte-anegimi weren't that bad, either.

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:25.800
Huh? This time an angel is coming?

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:30.880
Next time: "An Angel, a Trap, and the Queen's True Motives."

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:32.470
All of you in the Queen's army...

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:34.800
The next time I see any of you, I'll give you a real beating.

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:37.680
I am a true samurai, after all.
